cted\";s:5:\"items\";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"image\";s:26:\"images/contact-page-fb.svg\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Follow us on Facebook\";s:3:\"url\";s:39:\"https://www.facebook.com/GetFASolutions\";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:\"image\";s:29:\"images/contact-page-insta.svg\";s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Follow us on Instagram\";s:3:\"url\";s:41:\"https://www.instagram.com/get_fasolutions\";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:\"image\";s:31:\"images/contact-page-youtube.svg\";s:5:\"title\";s:24:\"Subscribe to our YouTube\";s:3:\"url\";s:56:\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-qnY7C0CVdCbLFUcmGsH4Q\";}i:3;a:3:{s:5:\"image\";s:32:\"images/contact-page-linkedin.svg\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Follow us on LinkedIn\";s:3:\"url\";s:48:\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/getfasolutions/\";}}}}',2105622959),('laravel-cache-page_content.faq','a:3:{s:6:\"banner\";a:2:{s:5:\"label\";s:12:\"FA Solutions\";s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Frequently Asked Questions\";}s:5:\"intro\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";s:59:\"If your questions are not answered here, please contact us.\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:71:\"Reach out to us anytime if you have any questions we can help you with.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:25:\"Get More Information Here\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:11:\"get-started\";s:11:\"paragraph_2\";N;s:11:\"paragraph_3\";N;s:5:\"image\";N;}s:5:\"items\";a:1:{s:5:\"items\";a:11:{i:0;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:79:\"Why should I use a third-party financial aid servicer to assist my institution?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:602:\"If your institution is recently accredited, FA Solutions can assist with navigating rules and regulations involved in the eligibility process.\nIf your institution has recently been approved for participation in the Title IV Programs, we can assist with the process of setting up the operational procedures involved the service and with developing and writing policies and procedures.\nIf your institution has experienced growth, added new locations and new programs, partnering with an experienced financial aid servicer can help you ensure that you are compliant with ever changing federal regulations.\";}i:1;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:31:\"What is a third-party servicer?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:949:\"The U.S. Department of EducationΓÇÖs formal definition of a third-party servicer is an individual, or a state, or a private, profit or non-profit organization that enters into a contract with an eligible institution to administer, through manual or automated processing, any aspect of the institutionΓÇÖs participation in any Title IV, HEA program.\n\nFA Solutions provides third-party servicing and more. We are a service-driven financial aid resource organization with a mission of providing higher education institutions of all sizes with a comprehensive portfolio of financial aid processing, compliance, remote staffing, and leadership needs at a cost-effective price point. One of our offerings includes third-party servicing which involves assisting independent and private post-secondary schools that do not have their own robust financial aid department to process federal funding applications and order fund disbursements for their students.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:38:\"Can you write policies and procedures?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:390:\"Yes. Federal regulations require schools to have written policies and procedures. FA Solutions will review and assess your policies and procedures to determine if all compliance areas are adequately addressed and whether your documentation meets minimum federal requirements. We can assist school with updating and creating policies and provide strategies for updating information annually.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:41:\"My Financial Aid Director left, now what?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:505:\"Under our Leadership staffing service, we will assign an experienced financial aid professional/consultant to serve as an interim director or fill another supervisory position with a redundant staffing plan to ensure uninterrupted financial aid services for your students and continued day-to-day leadership and guidance for your staff until a permanent replacement is in place. Once you hire your director, consider whether they could use temporary guidance and mentorship through our Mentorship service.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:47:\"We are in the middle of an audit, can you help?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:219:\"Yes, we can. During the site visit FA SolutionsΓÇÖ Compliance Team will provide support with answering questions from the auditor or federal officials. After the site visit has been completed, our team will assist with:\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:265:\"Analyzing the audit review findings or program review determination\nResearching regulatory issues,\nRequired file reconstructions\nDocumenting policies on an institution\'s behalf\nPreparing the schoolΓÇÖs response to the U.S. Department of Education, including appeals\";}i:5;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:43:\"Can you provide services on-site or remote?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:638:\"Yes. We are available for both on-site and remote assistance on a short or long-term basis. When FA Solutions was first established one of our goals was to offer complete redundancy of coverage in the event of a natural disaster. To do this, we invested heavily in cloud based technology to allow for remote staffing, while also allowing our employees to travel to unaffected areas so that work could be performed and service to students could continue with limited, or no interruption. Over the years this set-up has been heavily tested and fully operational, and we continue to provide uninterrupted service through the COVID-19 crisis.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:65:\"Is FA Solutions competitive with pricing compared to competitors?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:693:\"Absolutely. Everyone deserves the right to be cost-sensitive and receive good value for resources spent, and we keep this in mind as we customize our servicing solutions to fit the needs of each school that we work with. FA SolutionsΓÇÖ goal is to provide high level, quality services that add value to your institution. Our entire team is fully committed to delivering excellent service with superior results.\n\nOur service costs are assessed monthly and are based upon the number of students served. We can provide a detailed and customized proposal based upon the projected programs in which your institution participates and the number of projected students to be processed can be supplied.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:7;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:35:\"What are your onboarding timelines?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:122:\"Most services can be on boarded within 15 to 30 business days and some as little as 10 depending upon the services needed.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:8;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"What levels of financial aid staffing do you provide?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:874:\"FA SolutionsΓÇÖ provides interim staffing from counselor to director level during busy processing and enrollment periods, for replacement staffing, and to fill vacancies resulting from staff turnover or medical or maternity leaves. Our experienced financial aid professionals provide support remotely for certain functions, processes, or full positions. Remote staffing saves institutions a significant amount of financial resources by not having to charge for travel, lodging, meals, and other miscellaneous expenses normally incurred when interim staffing is required to be done on site at the institution itself. However, on-site interim staffing solutions are also available.\n\nOur staffing solutions are offered at a cost that is typically more favorable than hiring equally qualified and talented employees in-house or outsourcing to other third-party consulting firms.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:9;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:38:\"Do you provide a verification service?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:973:\"Yes. FA Solutions offers a customizable remote verification service that follows all Department of Education policies and procedures and ensures that the schoolΓÇÖs methods, policies and procedures align with federal regulations. Our Verification Specialists can handle part or all of the verification process and will make updates in your school-based system. They review documents for completion and 100% accuracy, and our internal audit team assists by conducting secondary reviews of a percentage of verifications. Our Verification Specialists also provide real time support by phone and live chat for any questions that your staff may have.\n\nOur Student Experience Center (SEC) team of professional Financial Aid Advisers and Enrollment Specialists can advise your students on how to complete the verification process. They can also provide extra support by reaching out to students to remind them to submit missing documents. The SEC is available as an added service.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}i:10;a:3:{s:8:\"question\";s:30:\"Can you do a compliance audit?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:1167:\"Yes. FA Solutions offers a comprehensive Financial Aid Department Regulatory and Operational Assessment; this proactive evaluation identifies potential regulatory liabilities and the cause(s) of processing inefficiencies. Our team of compliance professionals will conduct an in-depth review of financial aid files, policies and procedures, reports and records, identifying possible issues of noncompliance in all areas, such as budgets, file verification, awards, return of Title IV funds, disbursements, consumer information requirements, dependency overrides and other professional judgment decisions.\n\nFollowing this review, we will provide a written improvement plan that includes recommendations for specific corrective actions based on best practices to reduce compliance risks, improve file processing and workflow, as well as streamline operational efficiencies. We can also be engaged to assist with implementing the plan.\n\nWe recommend that institutions request the assessment well in advance of any serious concerns to allow ample time to make any adjustments or corrections needed prior to a request from the Department of Education for an official audit.\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:0:\"\";}}}}',2105623027),('laravel-cache-page_content.get-started','a:4:{s:6:\"banner\";a:2:{s:5:\"label\";s:16:\"Get Started With\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"FA Solutions\";}s:7:\"started\";a:11:{s:5:\"title\";s:42:\"Stronger Financial Aid Support Starts Here\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:407:\"Processing delays, staffing gaps, compliance demands, and unanswered student questions can\r\n                            quickly affect enrollment, retention, and trust. FA Solutions provides experienced financial\r\n                            aid professionals and scalable and flexible operational support to help your team stay\r\n                            responsive, compliant, and ready for what\'s next.\";s:16:\"newsletter_label\";s:28:\"Subscribe to our Newsletters\";s:13:\"button_1_text\";s:17:\"Join Our Webinars\";s:14:\"button_1_route\";s:7:\"webinar\";s:12:\"button_1_url\";N;s:13:\"button_2_text\";s:19:\"See How We Can Help\";s:14:\"button_2_route\";N;s:12:\"button_2_url\";s:54:\"http://dev.getfasolutions.digiperfecto.com/get-started\";s:18:\"contact_form_title\";s:12:\"Get in Touch\";s:16:\"recaptcha_notice\";s:88:\"This site is protected by reCAPTCHA. Google\'s Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\";}s:14:\"started_follow\";a:1:{s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Follow us\";}s:7:\"killers\";a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:41:\"The Silent Killers of Student Enrollment.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:34:\"Get Reliable Financial Aid Support\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:68:\"Processing delays arenΓÇÖt just paperworkΓÇötheyΓÇÖre lost students.\";s:11:\"paragraph_2\";s:98:\"Compliance isnΓÇÖt a ΓÇ£check-the-boxΓÇ¥ task; itΓÇÖs the foundation of your Title IV eligibility.\";s:11:\"paragraph_3\";s:95:\"Staffing shortages lead to ΓÇ£institutional memoryΓÇ¥ loss. We provide the redundancy you lack.\";}}',2105542428),('laravel-cache-page_content.home','a:8:{s:4:\"hero\";a:10:{s:5:\"title\";s:37:\"New Financial Aid Regs Are Here (OB3)\";s:8:\"subtitle\";s:33:\"Are You Prepared? Are You Really?\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:169:\"Staffing shortages, burnout, and processing backlogs are delaying responses to student calls and emails, leaving financial aid teams overwhelmed and students frustrated.\";s:11:\"paragraph_2\";s:179:\"FA Solutions provides experienced financial aid professionals and scalable shared or outsourced solutions to support financial aid processing operations and student communication.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:11:\"Get Started\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:11:\"get-started\";s:7:\"image_1\";s:28:\"images/FA+Solution-800h.webp\";s:11:\"image_1_alt\";s:35:\"Students collaborating in a library\";s:7:\"image_2\";s:40:\"images/FA+Solutions+FAFSA+(1)-1000h.webp\";s:11:\"image_2_alt\";s:40:\"Students receiving financial aid support\";}s:5:\"intro\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";s:37:\"Real People. Real Expertise.SIMULATED\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:306:\"FA Solutions partners with colleges as an extension to their team to strengthen financial aid operations and navigate compliance with confidence. Powered by experienced, full-time higher education financial aid professionals, we deliver consistent, reliable results institutions and students can depend on.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:13:\"Meet Our Team\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:4:\"team\";s:5:\"image\";N;s:11:\"paragraph_2\";N;s:11:\"paragraph_3\";N;}s:10:\"difference\";a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Our Difference:\";s:10:\"form_title\";s:12:\"Get in Touch\";s:5:\"items\";a:3:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:28:\"images/difference-icon-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Full-Time W2 Team\";s:7:\"content\";s:76:\"Unlike many competitors, we rely on full-time experts, not just consultants.\";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:28:\"images/difference-icon-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Decades of Experience\";s:7:\"content\";s:74:\"Our leadership team has been in higher ed financial aid for over 25 years.\";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:28:\"images/difference-icon-3.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:47:\"Custom Solutions, No One-Size-Fits-All Approach\";s:7:\"content\";s:47:\"Tailored services based on each school\'s needs.\";}}}s:3:\"why\";a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Why FA Solutions?\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:11:\"Get Started\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:11:\"get-started\";s:5:\"items\";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"We\'re an Extension of Your Team\";s:7:\"content\";s:64:\"We don\'t just offer services; we integrate with your operations.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"No Forced Platform Changes\";s:7:\"content\";s:50:\"We work with your existing financial aid software.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:46:\"Real Customer Service, Not Automated Responses\";s:7:\"content\";s:33:\"Immediate access to real experts.\";}}}s:8:\"services\";a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Our Services\";s:5:\"cards\";a:4:{i:0;a:7:{s:5:\"image\";s:59:\"images/Financial+Aid+Processing+FA+Solutions+(1)-1920w.webp\";s:9:\"image_alt\";s:39:\"Financial Aid Processing and Compliance\";s:5:\"title\";s:40:\"1. Financial Aid Processing & Compliance\";s:5:\"intro\";s:100:\"Slow, unresponsive third-party services are frustrating. We offer seamless financial aid processing:\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:241:\"Works with Most Major Student Systems ΓÇô No need to change platforms.\nLive Customer Support ΓÇô Real-time assistance all day during working hours.\nFull Compliance Oversight ΓÇô We ensure audits and program reviews don\'t become major issues.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:27:\"Learn More About Processing\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:24:\"financial-aid-processing\";}i:1;a:7:{s:5:\"image\";s:43:\"images/2.+Financial+Aid+Staffing-1920w.webp\";s:9:\"image_alt\";s:22:\"Financial Aid Staffing\";s:5:\"title\";s:25:\"2. Financial Aid Staffing\";s:5:\"intro\";s:127:\"Staffing shortages are costly and disruptive. Our staffing solutions have doubled client revenue from $30K to $60-70K annually:\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:160:\"Long-Term, Dependable Staff ΓÇô No short-term fixes.\nBuilt-in Redundancy ΓÇô 2-3 professionals per role.\nFlexible Support Models ΓÇô Remote, hybrid, or on-site.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:26:\"Explore Staffing Solutions\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:22:\"financial-aid-staffing\";}i:2;a:7:{s:5:\"image\";s:53:\"images/3.+Student+Outreach+-+Communication-1920w.webp\";s:9:\"image_alt\";s:34:\"Student Outreach and Communication\";s:5:\"title\";s:35:\"3. Student Outreach & Communication\";s:5:\"intro\";s:99:\"Colleges struggle with effective student communication. We offer a full-service contact center for:\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:179:\"Inbound & Outbound Support ΓÇô Phone, email, and mass text messaging.\nAI-Powered Two-Way Texting ΓÇô Real-time messaging.\nCustom Outreach Programs ΓÇô Mass messages for deadlines.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:29:\"Improve Student Communication\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:30:\"student-outreach-communication\";}i:3;a:7:{s:5:\"image\";s:40:\"images/FA+Solutions+FAFSA+(1)-1000h.webp\";s:9:\"image_alt\";s:49:\"Financial Aid Consulting and Operational Strategy\";s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"4. Financial Aid Consulting & Operational Strategy\";s:5:\"intro\";s:104:\"Many schools don\'t know they have compliance risks until it\'s too late. Our consulting services include:\";s:7:\"bullets\";s:202:\"Regulatory & Operational Assessments ΓÇô Prevent costly audit findings.\nTitle IV Approval & Accreditation Support ΓÇô Expert guidance.\nHCM1 & HCM2 Support ΓÇô Helping schools regain financial stability.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:29:\"Get Expert Compliance Support\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:24:\"financial-aid-consulting\";}}}s:7:\"success\";a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Client Success Stories\";s:8:\"subtitle\";s:35:\"How We\'ve Helped Schools Like Yours\";s:5:\"items\";a:3:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"content\";s:84:\"Large University ΓÇô Doubled efficiency while reducing financial aid staff turnover.\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"content\";s:84:\"Mid-Sized College ΓÇô Improved student engagement by 30% through proactive outreach.\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"content\";s:84:\"Small Private School ΓÇô Cleared financial aid application backlog in under 60 days.\";}}s:11:\"button_text\";s:22:\"Read More Case Studies\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:12:\"case-studies\";}s:13:\"image_gallery\";a:4:{s:7:\"image_1\";s:22:\"images/c-success-1.jpg\";s:11:\"image_1_alt\";s:42:\"Students collaborating in a campus setting\";s:7:\"image_2\";s:22:\"images/c-success-2.jpg\";s:11:\"image_2_alt\";s:42:\"Students working together on financial aid\";}s:3:\"faq\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Frequently Asked Questions\";s:5:\"image\";s:15:\"images/faq.webp\";s:9:\"image_alt\";s:31:\"Students at graduation ceremony\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:13:\"View All FAQs\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:3:\"faq\";s:5:\"items\";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"How do I sign up for services through FA Solutions?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:163:\"Getting started is simple. We begin with a quick consultation to learn more about your needs and goals, and to make sure we\'re the right fit for your organization.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:28:\"What does pricing look like?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:125:\"Our pricing depends on multiple factors, including institution size, pain points, experience levels needed, and systems used.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:37:\"How do you mitigate risk for schools?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:177:\"We help reduce the risk of audit findings, compliance violations, and financial instability by offering tailored solutions that ensure institutions meet regulatory requirements.\";}}}}',2105542360),('laravel-cache-page_content.webinar','a:3:{s:6:\"banner\";a:4:{s:5:\"label\";s:8:\"Webinars\";s:5:\"title\";s:46:\"Sign Up to Stay Informed for Upcoming Webinars\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:7:\"Sign Up\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:11:\"get-started\";}s:4:\"main\";a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:51:\"Access our previous Webinar Recorded Sessions here!\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:147:\"We are both dependable and responsive to our school partners, with the mutual\n                    goal\nof enhancing the overall student experience.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:13:\"WATCH WEBINAR\";s:11:\"paragraph_2\";s:125:\"This session is your gateway to mastering the art of unified strategies in enrollment\n                            management.\";s:11:\"paragraph_3\";s:156:\"In this session, we will dive into the challenges related to HCM2 compliance, audit issues or\n                            financial responsibility concerns.\";}s:8:\"sessions\";a:1:{s:5:\"items\";a:13:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:58:\"shattering-enrollment-silos--developing-unified-strategies\";s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"Rupak\";s:7:\"summary\";s:97:\"This session is your gateway to mastering the art of unified strategies in enrollment management.\";s:5:\"image\";s:29:\"images/webinar/shattering.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:36:\"successful-strategies-to-manage-hcm2\";s:5:\"title\";s:36:\"Successful Strategies to Manage HCM2\";s:7:\"summary\";s:128:\"In this session, we will dive into the challenges related to HCM2 compliance, audit issues or financial responsibility concerns.\";s:5:\"image\";s:23:\"images/webinar/hcm2.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";s:28:\"https://youtu.be/NQ_hUHrFfx8\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:95:\"2023-2024-fafsa-simplification-including-professional-judgements-and-cost-of-attendance-changes\";s:5:\"title\";s:95:\"2023-2024 FAFSA Simplification Including Professional Judgements and Cost of Attendance Changes\";s:7:\"summary\";s:184:\"The session will include an overview of the new FAFSA simplification requirements and how it affects professional judgements, cost of attendance, student eligibility and other changes.\";s:5:\"image\";s:29:\"images/webinar/fafsa-2023.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:67:\"fafsa-simplification--spotlighting-sai-and-the-new-pell-calculation\";s:5:\"title\";s:67:\"FAFSA Simplification: Spotlighting SAI and the New Pell Calculation\";s:7:\"summary\";s:217:\"Gain a better understanding of the upcoming FAFSA Simplification Act change and itΓÇÖs impact on the financial aid process. You will receive a basic understanding on the new Pell Grant calculation process and the SAI.\";s:5:\"image\";s:27:\"images/webinar/sai-pell.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:81:\"latest-and-greatest-fafsa-simplification-information-and-impact-to-your-fa-office\";s:5:\"title\";s:81:\"Latest and Greatest FAFSA Simplification Information and Impact to your FA Office\";s:7:\"summary\";s:127:\"This session delves deeper into the FAFSA Simplification Act\'s implications, particularly emphasizing its impact on FA Offices.\";s:5:\"image\";s:31:\"images/webinar/latest-fafsa.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:78:\"super-charge-student-experience-through-extraordinary-communication-strategies\";s:5:\"title\";s:78:\"Super Charge Student Experience through Extraordinary Communication Strategies\";s:7:\"summary\";s:277:\"Dive into the critical role of phone calls and emails in fostering meaningful connections with students. From initial inquiries to ongoing support, we\'ll explore strategies to maximize the effectiveness of these communication channels in keeping students engaged and satisfied.\";s:5:\"image\";s:32:\"images/webinar/communication.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:6;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:55:\"skills-financial-aid-employees-need-in-the-21st-century\";s:5:\"title\";s:55:\"Skills Financial Aid Employees need in the 21st Century\";s:7:\"summary\";s:257:\"Given the broad arms of financial aid regulations, the need for a sufficiently sized, well-trained financial aid office staff is evident. Join the Exclusive Panel Discussion to learn more about the skills you need to assess while hiring Financial Aid Staff.\";s:5:\"image\";s:25:\"images/webinar/skills.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:7;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:79:\"creating-an-efficient-financial-aid-office-by-eliminating-unnecessary-processes\";s:5:\"title\";s:79:\"Creating an Efficient Financial Aid office by Eliminating Unnecessary Processes\";s:7:\"summary\";s:381:\"Exclusive panel discussion with Amanda McCaughan, Director of Financial Aid, Concordia University ΓÇô St. Paul, Rita Franco, Financial Aid Director, Humphreys University, Nancy Rodriguez, Chief Executive Officer, BeOnAir Network of Media Schools, Bridget McGuire, VP of Operations, FA Solutions LLC and Rachel Gordon, Chief Operating Officer, Educational Compliance Management Inc.\";s:5:\"image\";s:28:\"images/webinar/efficient.png\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:8;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:63:\"best-practices-on-consumer-information--policies-and-procedures\";s:5:\"title\";s:63:\"Best Practices on Consumer Information, Policies and Procedures\";s:7:\"summary\";s:496:\"In this one-hour Webinar; Deana Coady, Vice President, Federal Policy and Reporting, University of Phoenix, Jeremy Burciaga, Vice President, Academic Dean, Southwest University at El Paso, Kimberly Warren, Title IV Regulatory Specialist, Educational Compliance Management Inc., Bridget McGuire, VP of Operations, FA Solutions LLC and Rachel Gordon, Chief Operating Officer, Educational Compliance Management Inc.; will throw light on financial aid trends and strategies for monitoring compliance.\";s:5:\"image\";s:27:\"images/webinar/consumer.png\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:9;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:62:\"breaking-down-silos-to-create-a-successful-enrollment-strategy\";s:5:\"title\";s:62:\"Breaking Down Silos to Create a Successful Enrollment Strategy\";s:7:\"summary\";s:231:\"In this one hour webinar, Financial Aid and Enrollment Management Department Professionals will get an overview of how they are unifying the goals with financial aid department to create a Successful Enrollment Management Strategy.\";s:5:\"image\";s:29:\"images/webinar/enrollment.png\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:10;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:63:\"professional-judgments--a-way-to-compliance-and-student-success\";s:5:\"title\";s:63:\"Professional Judgments- A way to Compliance and Student Success\";s:7:\"summary\";s:131:\"Learn from the industry experts on how are they are following guidelines to Professional Judgement and making Financial Aid easier.\";s:5:\"image\";s:31:\"images/webinar/professional.jpg\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:11;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:67:\"spotlight-covid-and-the-2-year-institutions--thriving-in-a-pandemic\";s:5:\"title\";s:67:\"Spotlight Covid and the 2 year institutions, thriving in a pandemic\";s:7:\"summary\";s:151:\"Exclusive panel discussion to throw a spotlight on #Covid and #2yearinstitutions, thriving in pandemic. Event will be MCΓÇÖd by Pamela Notemyer Rogers.\";s:5:\"image\";s:24:\"images/webinar/covid.png\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}i:12;a:5:{s:4:\"slug\";s:51:\"highered-leadership-transition-from-covid-to-campus\";s:5:\"title\";s:51:\"HigherEd Leadership Transition from Covid to Campus\";s:7:\"summary\";s:112:\"Learn from the industry experts on how are they are getting ready to transform this crisis into a renewing wave.\";s:5:\"image\";s:29:\"images/webinar/leadership.png\";s:9:\"video_url\";N;}}}}',2105456185),('laravel-cache-page_content.who-we-are','a:5:{s:6:\"banner\";a:2:{s:5:\"label\";s:8:\"About Us\";s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"Who We Are\";}s:13:\"about_partner\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Your Financial Aid Partner\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:363:\"FA Solutions isn\'t just another financial aid servicerΓÇöwe\'re a true partner to the institutions we work with. We integrate seamlessly with schools to enhance efficiency, ensure compliance, and deliver exceptional financial aid experiences. Our team is not only highly experienced but also deeply committed to the success of both institutions and their students.\";s:11:\"paragraph_2\";s:355:\"With a leadership team boasting 25+ years of financial aid experience and a staff of 100-200 full-time W2 financial aid professionals, we have the expertise and scale to support schools of all sizes. Unlike other providers that rely heavily on independent consultants, our full-time team ensures reliability, consistency, and deep institutional knowledge.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:11:\"Get Started\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:11:\"get-started\";s:5:\"image\";s:19:\"images/about-1.webp\";}s:13:\"about_believe\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"What We Believe\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:186:\"Choosing a financial aid partner is a critical decision. Just as schools must carefully evaluate their vendors, we ensure that our partnerships are a strong cultural and operational fit.\";s:11:\"paragraph_2\";s:257:\"We\'ve partnered with nearly 100 institutions over the past decade, offering industry-leading processing turnaround times and hands-on expertise in all major financial aid systems, including Anthology, Colleague, Banner, PowerFAIDS, Regent, and Campus Caf├⌐.\";s:11:\"paragraph_3\";s:259:\"At FA Solutions, we understand that financial aid is about more than just complianceΓÇöit\'s about ensuring students get the support they need. Our services help institutions streamline operations, reduce administrative burden, and enhance student experiences.\";s:11:\"button_text\";s:29:\"Learn More About Our Approach\";s:12:\"button_route\";s:11:\"get-started\";s:5:\"image\";s:22:\"images/about-2-new.jpg\";}s:7:\"clients\";a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:27:\"Partial List Of Our Clients\";s:11:\"paragraph_1\";s:93:\"We are proud to work with amazing clients that have provided raving reviews for our services.\";}s:3:\"faq\";a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Frequently Asked Questions\";s:5:\"image\";s:20:\"images/about-faq.png\";s:5:\"items\";a:5:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"How do I sign up for services through FA Solutions?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:227:\"We begin with a quick consultation to learn more about your needs and goals, and to make sure we\'re the right fit for your organization. From there, we\'ll walk you through the next steps and recommend the best solution for you.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:28:\"What does pricing look like?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:288:\"Pricing varies based on:Institution size and type\nExisting financial aid system\nLevel of expertise required\nComplexity of the institution\'s pain pointsWe are a premium serviceΓÇönot a discount providerΓÇöbecause compliance, efficiency, and student success are too important to compromise.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:39:\"Do you offer on-site or remote support?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:121:\"Yes! We offer both on-site and fully remote financial aid support, depending on your institution\'s needs and preferences.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"What levels of financial aid staffing do you provide?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:232:\"We provide long-term staffing solutions for financial aid offices, ensuring redundancy and eliminating turnover disruptions. Our staffing solutions include financial aid directors, processors, advisors, and verification specialists.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:34:\"Can you conduct compliance audits?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:146:\"Absolutely. We provide regulatory compliance audits, Title IV consulting, and operational assessments to prevent audit findings and mitigate risk.\";}}}}',2105623440),('laravel-cache-page_seo.about-us.','a:15:{s:10:\"meta_title\";s:42:\"About FA Solutions | Financial Aid Experts\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:154:\"Learn about FA Solutions ΓÇö experienced financial aid professionals partnering with institutions to improve efficiency, compliance, and student outcomes.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"meta_robots\";s:13:\"index, follow\";s:13:\"canonical_url\";s:30:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/about-us\";s:8:\"og_title\";s:42:\"About FA Solutions | Financial Aid Experts\";s:14:\"og_description\";s:154:\"Learn about FA Solutions ΓÇö experienced financial aid professionals partnering with institutions to improve efficiency, compliance, and student outcomes.\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:12:\"og_image_url\";N;s:7:\"og_type\";s:7:\"website\";s:12:\"twitter_card\";s:19:\"summary_large_image\";s:13:\"twitter_title\";s:42:\"About FA Solutions | Financial Aid Experts\";s:19:\"twitter_description\