INSERT INTO `our_services_cards` VALUES (1,0,'images/Financial+Aid+Processing+FA+Solutions+(1)-1920w.webp','Financial Aid Processing and Compliance','1. Financial Aid Processing & Compliance','Slow, unresponsive third-party services are frustrating. We offer seamless financial aid processing:','Works with Most Major Student Systems ΓÇô No need to change platforms. We support Anthology, Colleague, Banner, PowerFAIDS, Regent, Campus Caf├⌐, and more.\nLive Customer Support ΓÇô Real-time assistance all day during working hoursΓÇöno ticketing queues.\nFull Compliance Oversight ΓÇô We ensure audits and program reviews don\'t become major issues.','Learn More About Processing','financial-aid-processing',1,'2026-09-24 10:11:52','2026-09-24 10:11:52'),(2,1,'images/2.+Financial+Aid+Staffing-1920w.webp','Financial Aid Staffing','2. Financial Aid Staffing','Staffing shortages are costly and disruptive. Our staffing solutions have doubled client revenue from $30K to $60-70K annually:','Long-Term, Dependable Staff ΓÇô No short-term fixes. We provide reliable financial aid professionals.\nBuilt-in Redundancy ΓÇô Our model provides 2-3 professionals per role, ensuring coverage.\nFlexible Support Models ΓÇô We integrate seamlessly into your team, whether remote, hybrid, or on-site.','Explore Staffing Solutions','financial-aid-staffing',1,'2026-09-24 10:11:52','2026-09-24 10:11:52'),(3,2,'images/3.+Student+Outreach+-+Communication-1920w.webp','Student Outreach and Communication','3. Student Outreach & Communication','Colleges struggle with effective student communication. We offer a full-service contact center for:','Inbound & Outbound Support ΓÇô Phone, email, and mass text messaging options.\nAI-Powered Two-Way Texting ΓÇô Students prefer texting over calling. We offer real-time messaging.\nCustom Outreach Programs ΓÇô Schools can send mass messages to notify students about missing information or deadlines.','Improve Student Communication','student-outreach-communication',1,'2026-09-24 10:11:52','2026-09-24 10:11:52'),(4,3,'images/FA+Solutions+FAFSA+(1)-1000h.webp','Financial Aid Consulting and Operational Strategy','4. Financial Aid Consulting & Operational Strategy','Many schools don\'t know they have compliance risks until it\'s too late. Our consulting services include:','Regulatory & Operational Assessments ΓÇô Prevent costly audit findings and fines.\nTitle IV Approval & Accreditation Support ΓÇô Expert guidance through regulatory requirements.\nHCM1 & HCM2 Support ΓÇô Many servicers avoid these cases. We excel at helping schools regain financial stability.','Get Expert Compliance Support','financial-aid-consulting',1,'2026-09-24 10:11:52','2026-09-24 10:11:52');
